# Design reference material — kept on disk, deliberately out of git.
# 128 MB of .mp4/.gif clips and a deliverables zip. Git cannot diff video, so a
# binary that large never shrinks: it is carried by every clone and every Vercel
# build forever, and removing it later means rewriting history. It is reference,
# not source — nothing in the build reads it.
design/reference/
